      "body": "The screenshot alone does not make the defect obvious, so to be explicit about where to look:\n\n```\ndisplay name  ->  build a function for\n                                      ^ template begins here\ntitle         ->  build a function for needs your input\n```\n\nThe name is cut on \"for\", so the sentence has no object and reads as broken English. Nothing in the string marks where the session name stops and the message starts.\n\n<img width=\"1206\" height=\"2622\" alt=\"Notification titled: build a function for needs your input\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/55dff211-b1ec-40bf-a9a8-9984b6c9b850\" />\n",
