      "body": "Closing this under the mobile-first guidance \u2014 it is entirely daemon-side. The truncation happens in `delegatedTaskDisplayName` (`backend/internal/service/session/delegation.go:166-174`, with `delegatedTaskTitleLimit = 20` at `:18`), and `backend/internal/notify/enrich.go:36` splices that name into `\"%s needs your input\"`. Nothing in `packages/mobile` participates; the app renders the title the daemon sends.\n\nHappy to re-file it against the daemon if that is wanted.",
