    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "### Summary\n\nA delegated worker's display name is the task brief cut at 20 runes with no ellipsis, and the notification template splices it straight into a sentence with nothing marking where the name ends. The result reads as broken English rather than as a name plus a message.\n\nI spawned a worker with the brief `build a function for palindrome number`. Twenty runes lands exactly on `build a function for`, and `\"%s needs your input\"` turns that into `build a function for needs your input`.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Spawn a worker with a brief whose first 20 characters end mid-phrase, e.g. `build a function for palindrome number`.\n2. Let it stop for input.\n3. Open notifications, desktop or mobile.\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nA title that reads as a sentence. Quoting the name would do it, or cutting on a word boundary with an ellipsis.\n\n### Actual behavior\n\n```\nTitle: build a function for needs your input\nBody:  Your agent is waiting on you to continue.\n```\n\nStraight from the daemon's tables, so the split is unambiguous:\n\n```\nsessions.prompt        = 'build a function for palindrome number'\nsessions.display_name  = 'build a function for'   (20 runes, hard cut)\nnotifications.title    = 'build a function for needs your input'\n```\n\nThe same session now reads `Palindrome number fn needs your input` after the orchestrator renamed it, which is what the template is supposed to produce.\n\n`delegatedTaskDisplayName` in `backend/internal/service/session/delegation.go:164-173` does the hard 20-rune cut. `backend/internal/notify/enrich.go:36` builds `\"%s needs your input\"` from whatever came out, via `sessionLabel` at `:82-90`.\n\nNearby but not the same: #3033 is this template with a session id rather than a display name, and #3912 covers the truncation scoped to the sidebar. Neither open PR fixes it either. #4267 adds a second template on the same helper (`\"%s finished its turn\"`), and #4490 keeps the 20-rune provisional name.\n\n### AO version\n\n0.12.11-nightly.202609011721 (packaged app); daemon from origin/main d6350bc47\n\n### Environment\n\nmacOS 26.5 arm64\n\n### Before submitting\n\n- [X] I searched existing issues for duplicates\n- [X] I removed secrets / tokens from logs and screenshots",
